/story/_/id/50577602/sec-consider-termination-lsu-membership","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia defensive coordinator Glenn Schumann agrees to coach Florida State","description":"Georgia's Glenn Schumann, one of the country's top defensive coordinators and part of a staff that has the Bulldogs at No. 1 in the CFP rankings, agreed to a five-year deal to become the next coach at Florida State, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T02:51:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577665/uga-defensive-coordinator-schumann-coach-florida-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Aiden Flora, nation's leading rusher, re-signs with Iowa State for next season","description":"Iowa State running back Aiden Flora, who leads the nation in rushing, announced Monday that he has re-signed with the Cyclones for next season.","published":"2026-11-23T23:57:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577520/aiden-flora-nation-leading-rusher-re-signs-iowa-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"David Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Texas A&M names John Thornton interim athletic director effective Dec. 1","description":"John Thornton will take over as interim athletic director at Texas A&M, effective Dec. 1, replacing the departed Trev Alberts.","published":"2026-11-23T22:07:34.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50576559/texas-names-john-thornton-interim-ad-effective-dec-1","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Giants DC Dennard Wilson interviews for HC job at alma mater Maryland","description":"Giants defensive coordinator Dennard Wilson had a virtual interview recently for the vacant head coaching job at Maryland, sources told NFL Network.","published":"2026-11-23T21:22:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50575838/sources-giants-dennard-wilson-interviews-maryland-job","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"LSU's Lane Kiffin apologizes for using profanity during halftime interview","description":"LSU coach Lane Kiffin has apologized for using profanity during a halftime interview with the school's radio network in Saturday's loss to Tennessee.","published":"2026-11-23T20:12:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575735/lsu-kiffin-apologizes-use-profanity-interview","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079337/eli-bowen","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eli_Bowen_(American_football)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Eli Bowen (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eli_Bowen_(American_football)","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Eli Bowen (born October 15, 2005) is an American college football defensive back for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Bowen attended John H. Guyer High School in Denton, Texas. As a sophomore, he recorded 46 tackles and ten interceptions. As a senior, he totaled 34 tackles, two tackles-for-loss, and three interceptions. A four-star recruit, Bowen committed to play college football at the University of Oklahoma over an offer from Texas."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman in 2024, Bowen received significant playing time, making an immediate impact. In his first career start against Texas, he led the team in tackles with eight. Against Alabama, Bowen recorded his first career interception at the collegiate level."}],"family":[{"relation":"Sibling","name":"Peyton Bowen","description":"American football cornerback","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peyton_Bowen"}]}}